@startuml
title PIPE — Create and Track Offer

skinparam dpi 300
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #CBD5E1
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam ActorBorderColor #3B82F6
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #94A3B8
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam QueueBorderColor #A855F7
skinparam QueueBackgroundColor #FAF5FF

hide footbox
autonumber

actor "Recruiter / Admin" as Recruiter
boundary "Pipeline / Offer UI" as UI
control "Spring Security" as Security
control "TenantWebInterceptor" as Interceptor
boundary "HiringDecisionController" as Controller
control "HiringDecisionService" as Service
database "Tenant DB (MySQL)" as TenantDB
queue "RabbitMQ notify-email" as RabbitMQ

note over Recruiter, Security
  Preconditions: tenant ACTIVE; caller can decide on the job;
  application is not already HIRED or REJECTED.
end note

== Create offer ==

Recruiter -> UI: Issue offer for a candidate
activate UI
UI -> Security: POST /api/v1/applications/{id}/offers
activate Security

alt Unauthenticated or forbidden
  Security --> UI: 401 Unauthorized / 403 Forbidden
  deactivate Security
  UI --> Recruiter: Show access error
else Authorized
  Security -> Interceptor: Forward authenticated request
  activate Interceptor
  deactivate Security
  Interceptor -> Interceptor: setCurrentTenant(tenantId)
  Interceptor -> Controller: Route request
  activate Controller
  Controller -> Service: createOffer(actorId, id, request)
  activate Service
  Service -> TenantDB: Load Application and Offer stage
  activate TenantDB
  TenantDB --> Service: Card and stage
  deactivate TenantDB

  alt Missing, stale, or already terminal
    Service --> Controller: 404 / 409 / 422
    deactivate Service
    Controller --> UI: Error status
    deactivate Controller
    UI --> Recruiter: Show why offer is blocked
  else Eligible application
    Service -> TenantDB: INSERT HiringDecision OFFER
    activate TenantDB
    TenantDB --> Service: Decision saved
    deactivate TenantDB
    Service -> TenantDB: UPDATE status=OFFER, stage=Offer, updated_at
    activate TenantDB
    TenantDB --> Service: Card saved
    deactivate TenantDB
    Service -> TenantDB: INSERT status history (audit)
    activate TenantDB
    TenantDB --> Service: Audit row
    deactivate TenantDB
    Service -> RabbitMQ: publishOfferEvent(OFFER_CREATED)
    activate RabbitMQ
    RabbitMQ --> Service: Accepted
    deactivate RabbitMQ
    Service --> Controller: OfferResponse
    deactivate Service
    Controller --> UI: 201 Created
    deactivate Controller
    UI --> Recruiter: Card in Offer column
  end
  Interceptor -> Interceptor: clear TenantContext
  deactivate Interceptor
end

== Track or resolve offer ==

Recruiter -> UI: Open offer or record hire/reject
UI -> Security: GET offer or POST /applications/{id}/decisions
activate Security
Security -> Interceptor: Forward after RBAC
activate Interceptor
deactivate Security
Interceptor -> Interceptor: setCurrentTenant(tenantId)
Interceptor -> Controller: Route request
activate Controller

alt Track only
  Controller -> Service: getLatest(applicationId)
  activate Service
  Service -> TenantDB: Latest HiringDecision and Application
  activate TenantDB
  TenantDB --> Service: Offer snapshot
  deactivate TenantDB
  Service --> Controller: OfferResponse
  deactivate Service
  Controller --> UI: 200 OK
  deactivate Controller
  UI --> Recruiter: Show current offer status
else Hire or reject
  Controller -> Service: decide(actorId, id, request)
  activate Service
  Service -> TenantDB: Load Application (must be OFFER)
  activate TenantDB
  TenantDB --> Service: Card
  deactivate TenantDB

  alt Not in OFFER or reason missing on REJECT
    Service --> Controller: 422 DECISION_NOT_ALLOWED
    deactivate Service
    Controller --> UI: Error status
    deactivate Controller
    UI --> Recruiter: Show blocked decision
  else Decision allowed
    Service -> TenantDB: INSERT HiringDecision HIRE or REJECT
    activate TenantDB
    TenantDB --> Service: Decision saved
    deactivate TenantDB
    Service -> TenantDB: UPDATE terminal status/stage and history
    activate TenantDB
    TenantDB --> Service: Card locked
    deactivate TenantDB
    Service -> RabbitMQ: publishOfferEvent(HIRED or REJECTED)
    activate RabbitMQ
    RabbitMQ --> Service: Accepted
    deactivate RabbitMQ
    Service --> Controller: OfferResponse
    deactivate Service
    Controller --> UI: 200 OK
    deactivate Controller
    UI --> Recruiter: Terminal column updated
  end
end

Interceptor -> Interceptor: clear TenantContext
deactivate Interceptor
deactivate UI

note over TenantDB
  Terminal HIRED/REJECTED is not reopened in this function.
  Mail failure does not roll back the decision; retry is the notify worker.
end note

@enduml
